== Theorem 1: NGM, sign equivalence, root characterisation ==
instances 400 by kind {'symmetric': 103, 'dense': 82, 'nonrev': 96, 'departure': 119}
max |s(M+bQ/R0-g)|           = 1.347e-14
sign(R0-1) != sign(lambda1)  : 0 failures
max |lambda1| at beta/R0     = 1.286e-14
max imag part of Perron root = 0.000e+00
-- Theorem 1(d): K = beta Q * Laplace transform of the propagator at gamma
n=18: rel. error of Laguerre-quadrature Laplace transform vs (gamma-M)^-1 = 3.11e-06
max |1^T V^-1 - 1/gamma| = 6.66e-16
-- Theorem 1(e): Monte-Carlo sojourn times of one infective vs V^-1 column
3x4 lattice, 4000000 lifetimes: max |MC sojourn - V^-1[:,s0]| = 2.11e-04 (entries ~ 0.119); z-scores (batch-means SE): max |z| = 1.57, rms z = 1.05; sum MC = 1.4285 vs 1/gamma = 1.4286
-- Theorem 1'(f): Rayleigh/Ritz (symmetric generators)
max rel |R0_generalised - R0_NGM|      = 8.03e-15
max rel (largest diag. modal - R0)    = -3.96e-04   (<= 0 : modal formula is a LOWER bound)
Ritz not monotone in #modes            : 0 failures;  full-basis rel err 6.78e-14
departure model: max(asymmetry of Pi^-1/2 M Pi^1/2, rel err Rayleigh vs NGM) = 1.29e-14
