== Theorem 5: hotspot maps ==
(i)  early-time profile -> Perron vector u of M+bQ-g: max rel err 5.89e-14
(ii) generation profile K^g -> w: max rel err 4.47e-14
(iii) elasticities: |sum e - 1| <= 4.44e-16; finite-difference check max rel err 3.87e-05
(iv) symmetric case e_r ~ q_r x_r^2: max rel err 2.53e-14
(v) D->inf: max|u - pi| = 1.54e-08;  D->0: mass of u on argmax q = 1.000000
